[34.458943, "o", "\u001b[29A\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mSession: session-20261112-232419-696-0\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mPermissions: auto-allow\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[90m  Tip: Run \u001b[1m/model\u001b[22m to switch models on the fly.\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[2m\u2298 Indexing skipped: no project root found\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255m > Use the Kali MCP server to run an nmap scan of TCP port 57889 on 172.17.0.1, using no other \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mnetwork access and creating or running no files outside the current directory. When the scan \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mfinishes, print one concise, clearly labeled terminal result stating whether the port is open or \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mclosed; do not show a long real-time animation. \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;75m\u26a1 loading skill: pentest \u2014 MCP tools enabled\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;35m\u25cf \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan skill(Activated the \"pentest\" stance: Conduct authori...)\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[4G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m\u2234 Thinking #1\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[4G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;35m\u25cf \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan mcp__kali__connect(Connected to MCP server 'kali'. 21 tools availa...) 0.8s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[21G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;35m\u001b[39m\u001b[2mnmap_scan(Starting Nmap 7.98 ( https://nmap.org ) at 2026...) 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[4G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m\u2234 Thinking #2\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KPort 57889/tcp on 172.17.0.1: \u001b[1mCLOSED\u001b[22m.\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\